      "geometry": "rect",
      "text": "Because observed and product assignment preserve the same worker and firm marginals:\n  E_obs[m_IJ] - E_prod[m_IJ] = E_obs[h_IJ] = A_h.\n\nWhy additive terms drop out:\n  E_obs[a_I] = E_prod[a_I] and E_obs[b_J] = E_prod[b_J].\n\nInterpretation:\n  A_h > 0 means observed matches occupy wage cells with positive interaction residuals.\n\nCaution:\n  A_h is a fixed-wage-schedule statement. It is not automatically welfare, production complementarity, or surplus.",
